    <description>IMPORTANT: This package version requires Studio v2020.10 or above. Installing it on versions lower than the recommended one may cause unexpected issues in your workflows.

      Core activities which enable the robots to manipulate data stored in UiPath Data Service. These activities allow you to execute operations such as create, update, read, search or delete on records stored in Data Service Entities.</description>
